<title>USA: U.S. stockpile revises vanadium sales dates.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile revises vanadium sales dates.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it has revised the dates of offerings for vanadium pentoxide in November and December due to Thanksgiving and Christmas holidays.</p>
<p>The bid opening scheduled for the fourth Thursday in November, Nov 28, and in December, Dec 26, have been rescheduled to Thursday, Dec 5 and Thursday, Jan 9, 1997, respectively, both at 1000 EST.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
